<title>USA: Community Bankshares sets shr repurchase.</title>
<headline>Community Bankshares sets shr repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>PETERSBURG, Va. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Bankshares Inc said Friday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 50,000 shares of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a news release it has 2,768,714 issued and outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
